{
  "$comment": "THE SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for the design-token contract. Owned by the library (its components consume these var(--…) names via Tailwind aliases); the backend projector (services/blueprint/projection.py) fills them from the Living Blueprint's designSystem, and check_design_system verifies every token is fed and every projected colour is read. A component may reference ONLY tokens listed here; a palette change edits the Blueprint's roles and reaches every token by this map. Values are HSL triplets (space-separated H S% L%) so a Tailwind alias `hsl(var(--x))` and a raw `var(--x)` both resolve. Add a token here, wire its Tailwind alias + theme.css default, and it is honoured end to end.",
